3	MG90S micro servo	Position-controlled micro servo	6	Actuates the six Braille dots
4	Regulated DC power supply	5 V, 10 A proposed rating	1	Supplies power to the servo system
5	Push buttons	Momentary switches	4	Previous, Next, Home and Reset inputs
6	Breadboard or prototyping board	Suitable for the selected wiring arrangement	1	Supports initial circuit assembly
