7. Procurement and Validation Status

This BOM represents the proposed component plan. It does not indicate that the components have already been purchased or tested.

Before assembly, the selected components will be checked for compatibility, electrical ratings, mechanical fit and availability.

Quantities, specifications and costs will be updated if the final design changes during development.

8. Future Improvements

Potential improvements include:

* Replaceable Braille-cell modules.
* Easier access to individual servos and pins for repair.
* A compact and robust enclosure.
* Improved mechanical alignment and reduced friction.
* Expansion from one cell to four cells after successful validation.
* Cost optimisation based on prototype results.
